{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.QuarkState.OverStrandWeight","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.QuarkState.OverStrandWeight","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.Matrix.Notation","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":15,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.OverStrandWeight.over_e1_iff_pure","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.OverStrandWeight.over_e1_iff_pure","kind":"theorem","line":122,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/OverStrandWeight.lean#L122-L133","doc":"**Over/under rule, both signs.** At `h ≠ 0`, a crossing keeps each strand's label\n(pure transposition) iff its over strand carries `e₁`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.OverStrandWeight.Rinv_e12","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.OverStrandWeight.Rinv_e12","kind":"theorem","line":117,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/OverStrandWeight.lean#L117-L120","doc":"Negative crossing, over strand carries `e₂`: an extra `−h` on the input (label exchange). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.OverStrandWeight.Rinv_e21","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.OverStrandWeight.Rinv_e21","kind":"theorem","line":112,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/OverStrandWeight.lean#L112-L115","doc":"Negative crossing, over strand (position `i + 1`) carries `e₁`: pure transposition. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.OverStrandWeight.Rch_e21","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.OverStrandWeight.Rch_e21","kind":"theorem","line":108,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/OverStrandWeight.lean#L108-L110","doc":"Positive crossing, over strand carries `e₂`: an extra `h` on the input (label exchange). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.OverStrandWeight.Rch_e12","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.OverStrandWeight.Rch_e12","kind":"theorem","line":104,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/OverStrandWeight.lean#L104-L106","doc":"Positive crossing, over strand (position `i`) carries `e₁`: pure transposition. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.OverStrandWeight.ptr_other_not_scalar","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.OverStrandWeight.ptr_other_not_scalar","kind":"theorem","line":92,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/OverStrandWeight.lean#L92-L102","doc":"**The other orientation is not a Markov trace**: `K = diag(q⁻¹, q)` gives a non-scalar. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.OverStrandWeight.ptr_markov_inv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.OverStrandWeight.ptr_markov_inv","kind":"theorem","line":85,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/OverStrandWeight.lean#L85-L90","doc":"The same `K` is Markov for the negative crossing too (`q⁻² · 1`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.OverStrandWeight.markov_z_eq_zD","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.OverStrandWeight.markov_z_eq_zD","kind":"theorem","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/OverStrandWeight.lean#L79-L83","doc":"The resulting Markov parameter is `z_D = q³/(q² + 1)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.OverStrandWeight.ptr_markov","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.OverStrandWeight.ptr_markov","kind":"theorem","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/OverStrandWeight.lean#L74-L77","doc":"**Markov at convention D**: `K = diag(q, q⁻¹)` gives `q² · 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.OverStrandWeight.ptr","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.OverStrandWeight.ptr","kind":"def","line":69,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/OverStrandWeight.lean#L69-L72","doc":"Partial quantum trace over the second factor with weight `K = diag(d₁, d₂)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.OverStrandWeight.Rch_mul_Rinv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.OverStrandWeight.Rch_mul_Rinv","kind":"theorem","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/OverStrandWeight.lean#L65-L67","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.OverStrandWeight.Rch_hecke","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.OverStrandWeight.Rch_hecke","kind":"theorem","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/OverStrandWeight.lean#L58-L63","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.OverStrandWeight.b","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.OverStrandWeight.b","kind":"def","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/OverStrandWeight.lean#L55-L56","doc":"Basis vector `b i`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.OverStrandWeight.Rinv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.OverStrandWeight.Rinv","kind":"def","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/OverStrandWeight.lean#L52-L53","doc":"The negative crossing `Ř⁻¹ = Ř − h`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.OverStrandWeight.Rch","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.OverStrandWeight.Rch","kind":"def","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/OverStrandWeight.lean#L45-L50","doc":"The Jimbo matrix `Ř` on `C² ⊗ C²` (basis `e₁e₁, e₁e₂, e₂e₁, e₂e₂`), `h` on `e₂e₁`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}